{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"Cedric API","version":"1.0.0","summary":"Talk to your Cedric workspace from code.","description":"Cedric is an AI employee for Slack, Telegram and Discord. He joins your meetings, works in the tools you connect and asks before anything is sent or changed.\n\nThis API reaches him from code: scripts, tests, automations and your own agents. Every caller acts as the person who signed in or owns the key, in their workspace, with their access and the workspace's credits.\n\nThree endpoints: `/api/v1/chat` runs one whole turn and returns his reply, `/api/v1/files` uploads local files, and `/api/v1/mcp` is a Model Context Protocol server exposing his tools to any MCP client.\n\nKeys are created in Cedric's Settings, on the MCP tab. A key has a mode, chosen when it is created: under a standard key, sends and writes wait for a person's approval; a direct key runs them immediately. Full reference: https://github.com/meet-cedric/cedric-mcp/blob/main/docs/api.md","termsOfService":"https://meet-cedric.com/terms","contact":{"name":"Cedric","url":"https://meet-cedric.com","email":"ben@meet-cedric.com"},"license":{"name":"Cedric Terms of Service","url":"https://meet-cedric.com/terms"},"x-logo":{"url":"https://app.meet-cedric.com/icon-512.png","altText":"Cedric"}},"externalDocs":{"description":"API reference, tools and examples","url":"https://github.com/meet-cedric/cedric-mcp/blob/main/docs/api.md"},"servers":[{"url":"https://app.meet-cedric.com","description":"Cedric"}],"tags":[{"name":"Chat","description":"One request, one whole turn."},{"name":"Files","description":"Upload local files for his tools to use."},{"name":"MCP","description":"His tools over the Model Context Protocol."}],"security":[{"apiKey":[]}],"paths":{"/api/v1/chat":{"post":{"operationId":"runChatTurn","tags":["Chat"],"summary":"Run one turn and get the reply","description":"Runs a normal Cedric turn, the same as every other surface (memory, connected tools, scheduling and credits all apply), and returns the reply as JSON when the turn completes. Takes an API key. Limit: 30 requests per minute per key.","security":[{"apiKey":[]}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ChatRequest"},"examples":{"ask":{"summary":"Ask something","value":{"message":"Summarize this week for the team"}},"continue":{"summary":"Continue a session","value":{"message":"Now post it in #team","session":"abc123"}},"fresh":{"summary":"Start a fresh session","value":{"message":"What did we decide about pricing?","session":"new"}}}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"The turn completed.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ChatResponse"},"example":{"reply":"...","session":"abc123","outcome":"answered"}}}},"400":{"description":"The message is missing or too long.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"},"example":{"error":"message is required"}}}},"401":{"description":"The key or token is missing, malformed, expired or revoked, or its owner left the workspace.","headers":{"WWW-Authenticate":{"description":"Points a client at the sign-in metadata.","schema":{"type":"string"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"},"example":{"error":"missing or malformed API key"}}}},"409":{"description":"The workspace cannot take the request right now.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"},"example":{"error":"workspace has no active installation"}}}},"429":{"description":"The key's rate limit was reached.","headers":{"Retry-After":{"description":"Seconds to wait before the next request.","schema":{"type":"integer"},"example":60}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"},"example":{"error":"rate limited: at most 30 requests per minute per key"}}}},"500":{"description":"The turn failed.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"},"example":{"error":"..."}}}}}}},"/api/v1/files":{"post":{"operationId":"uploadFiles","tags":["Files"],"summary":"Upload local files","description":"A tool call is JSON and has no room for a video, so a file on your machine comes in here as multipart form-data: up to 5 files per request, 100 MB each. The answer lists each file's id, which his tools take wherever a stored file is expected. A file is kept for 30 days, a year once shared, or for good with `keep`. One that could not be stored is listed in `refused` with the reason, and the others still go through. Takes an API key or a sign-in token. Limit: 60 requests per minute per key, shared with the MCP endpoint.","security":[{"apiKey":[]},{"signIn":["cedric:standard"]}],"parameters":[{"name":"share","in":"query","required":false,"description":"Set to 1 to also get a public link for each stored file.","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["1","true","yes"]}}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"multipart/form-data":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["files"],"properties":{"files":{"type":"array","maxItems":5,"items":{"type":"string","format":"binary"},"description":"The files. Repeat the field for each one."},"keep":{"type":"string","enum":["1","true","yes"],"description":"Keep the files for good."},"path":{"type":"string","description":"The folder to file them under.","example":"sales/decks"}}}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"At least one file was stored.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/FilesResponse"},"example":{"files":[{"id":"f_...","filename":"teaser.mp4","mimetype":"video/mp4","sizeBytes":18234001,"url":"...","expiresInDays":30}],"refused":[]}}}},"400":{"description":"The body is not multipart form-data.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"},"example":{"error":"expected multipart form-data with a \"files\" field"}}}},"401":{"description":"The key or token is missing, malformed, expired or revoked, or its owner left the workspace.","headers":{"WWW-Authenticate":{"description":"Points a client at the sign-in metadata.","schema":{"type":"string"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"},"example":{"error":"missing or malformed API key"}}}},"409":{"description":"The workspace cannot take the request right now.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"},"example":{"error":"workspace has no active installation"}}}},"413":{"description":"The request body is too large.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"},"example":{"error":"request body too large"}}}},"422":{"description":"No file was stored. Each one is listed in `refused` with the reason.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/FilesResponse"}}}},"429":{"description":"The key's rate limit was reached.","headers":{"Retry-After":{"description":"Seconds to wait before the next request.","schema":{"type":"integer"},"example":60}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"},"example":{"error":"rate limited: at most 60 requests per minute per key"}}}}}}},"/api/v1/mcp":{"post":{"operationId":"sendMcpMessage","tags":["MCP"],"summary":"Send one MCP message","description":"A Model Context Protocol server over Streamable HTTP. Each request carries one JSON-RPC 2.0 message: `initialize`, `tools/list`, `tools/call` or `ping`. The tool list is what Cedric offers this caller, and it grows as the workspace connects apps, so it is discovered with `tools/list` and not listed here. Call the `getting_started` tool first; `ask_cedric` hands him a whole task. Takes an API key or a sign-in token. Limits: 60 requests per minute per key, shared with file uploads, and a body of up to 200,000 characters.","security":[{"apiKey":[]},{"signIn":["cedric:standard"]}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/JsonRpcRequest"},"examples":{"listTools":{"summary":"List the tools","value":{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"method":"tools/list"}},"callTool":{"summary":"Call a tool","value":{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":2,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"recall_memories","arguments":{"query":"pricing decisions"}}}},"delegate":{"summary":"Hand a whole task to Cedric","value":{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":3,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"ask_cedric","arguments":{"message":"Summarize this week for the team"}}}}}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"The JSON-RPC answer. A long `ask_cedric` call from a client that sent a progress token and accepts `text/event-stream` is answered as an event stream: progress messages, then the answer.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/JsonRpcResponse"}},"text/event-stream":{"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Server-sent events, each carrying one JSON-RPC message."}}}},"202":{"description":"A notification was accepted. No body."},"401":{"description":"The key or token is missing, malformed, expired or revoked, or its owner left the workspace.","headers":{"WWW-Authenticate":{"description":"Points a client at the sign-in metadata.","schema":{"type":"string"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"},"example":{"error":"missing or malformed API key"}}}},"413":{"description":"The request body is too large.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"},"example":{"error":"request body too large"}}}},"429":{"description":"The key's rate limit was reached.","headers":{"Retry-After":{"description":"Seconds to wait before the next request.","schema":{"type":"integer"},"example":60}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"},"example":{"error":"rate limited: at most 60 requests per minute per key"}}}}}}}},"components":{"securitySchemes":{"apiKey":{"type":"http","scheme":"bearer","bearerFormat":"cedric_sk_...","description":"An API key, created in Cedric's Settings on the MCP tab and sent as `Authorization: Bearer cedric_sk_...`. Revoking the key is the whole off-switch."},"signIn":{"type":"oauth2","description":"The browser sign-in an MCP client runs by itself (OAuth 2.1 with PKCE and dynamic client registration). Tokens issued this way always run in standard mode. Metadata: `/.well-known/oauth-authorization-server` and `/.well-known/oauth-protected-resource`.","flows":{"authorizationCode":{"authorizationUrl":"https://app.meet-cedric.com/api/oauth/authorize","tokenUrl":"https://app.meet-cedric.com/api/oauth/token","refreshUrl":"https://app.meet-cedric.com/api/oauth/token","scopes":{"cedric:standard":"Act as the signed-in person in their workspace, in standard mode."}}}}},"schemas":{"Error":{"type":"object","required":["error"],"properties":{"error":{"type":"string","description":"What went wrong, in words."}}},"ChatRequest":{"type":"object","required":["message"],"properties":{"message":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":8000,"description":"What you want Cedric to do or answer."},"session":{"type":"string","description":"A session key to continue, or `new` to start fresh. Left out, the key talks in its own conversation."}}},"ChatResponse":{"type":"object","required":["reply","session","outcome"],"properties":{"reply":{"type":"string","description":"Cedric's reply."},"session":{"type":"string","description":"The session key, for reuse."},"outcome":{"type":"string","description":"Usually `answered`. `proposal_created` when the turn raised something for a person to approve, `budget_blocked` when the workspace is out of credits.","examples":["answered","proposal_created","budget_blocked"]},"files":{"type":"array","description":"Present when the turn made files.","items":{"type":"object","required":["filename"],"properties":{"filename":{"type":"string"},"url":{"type":"string","description":"Where to download the file."}}}}}},"StoredFile":{"type":"object","required":["id","filename","mimetype","sizeBytes","url","expiresInDays"],"properties":{"id":{"type":"string","description":"The file's id, which his tools take."},"filename":{"type":"string"},"mimetype":{"type":"string"},"sizeBytes":{"type":"integer"},"url":{"type":"string","description":"Where the file's owner can download it."},"shareUrl":{"type":"string","description":"The public link, when `share` was set."},"expiresInDays":{"type":["integer","null"],"description":"Days until the file is removed; null when it is kept for good."}}},"RefusedFile":{"type":"object","required":["filename","reason"],"properties":{"filename":{"type":"string"},"reason":{"type":"string"}}},"FilesResponse":{"type":"object","required":["files","refused"],"properties":{"files":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/StoredFile"}},"refused":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/RefusedFile"}}}},"JsonRpcRequest":{"type":"object","required":["jsonrpc","method"],"properties":{"jsonrpc":{"type":"string","const":"2.0"},"id":{"type":["string","integer","null"],"description":"Left out for a notification, which gets no answer."},"method":{"type":"string","examples":["initialize","tools/list","tools/call","ping"]},"params":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":true}}},"JsonRpcResponse":{"type":"object","required":["jsonrpc","id"],"properties":{"jsonrpc":{"type":"string","const":"2.0"},"id":{"type":["string","integer","null"]},"result":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":true},"error":{"type":"object","required":["code","message"],"properties":{"code":{"type":"integer"},"message":{"type":"string"}}}}}}}}